<h2>Straightforward Inspections and Estimates</h2>
<p>Our inspections are free and carry no obligation. We look at every building you ask us to, photograph what we find, and explain your options in plain language with a written estimate. If a few fasteners and a section of flashing will fix the problem, that is what we will recommend. For storm claims, we can document damage and meet your adjuster if you ask. We are roofers, not public adjusters, and under Texas law the homeowner pays the deductible.</p>
